WEBVTT

00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:02.643
Anthony Veneziale: You might think
I know what you're going through.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.434
You might be looking at me
here on the red dot,

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:08.726
or you might be looking
at me on the screen.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.518
There's a one sixth of a second delay.

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:15.559
Did I catch myself? I did.

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:18.934
I could see myself before I turned,

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:23.018
and that small delay
creates a little bit of a divide.

00:01:23.042 --> 00:01:26.125
(Laughter)

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:32.434
And a divide is exactly what happens
with human language,